// A folder is a package: `import shapes` loads shapes/lib.aion, `import shapes.circle` loads shapes/circle.aion.
// `@util` starts at the root of this program; `.circle` (inside shapes/lib.aion) starts at the importing file's folder.
// Names starting with `_` are private to their file.
import shapes
import shapes.circle
import @util

println(shapes.describe(2))
println(circle.area(3), util.double(21))
println(shapes.hint())

// > a circle of radius 2 has area 12 (doubled: 24)
// > 27 42
// > only this file can call _secret
